---
const books = [
  {
    name: 'BetMGM',
    note: 'Tracked feed',
  },
  {
    name: 'DraftKings',
    note: 'Tracked feed',
  },
  {
    name: 'FanDuel',
    note: 'Tracked feed',
  },
];
---

<section class="section section--surface">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label">Supported Books</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Tracked sportsbook feeds</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      BettorIndex pulls from BetMGM, DraftKings, and FanDuel, then surfaces the best line and price available from those feeds. It does not show every book on every market every time.
    </p>

    <div class="books">
      {books.map((book) => (
        <div class="book-card">
          <div class="book-card__mark" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <h3 class="book-card__name">{book.name}</h3>
          <p class="book-card__note">{book.note}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="books__footnote">
      When books disagree, BettorIndex shows the range. When they agree, the card pushes you toward price shopping instead of number shopping.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .books {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .book-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 24px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(21, 29, 43, 0.95), rgba(17, 23, 34, 0.98));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .book-card__mark {
    width: 42px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .book-card__name {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .book-card__note {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .books__footnote {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 720px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .books {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
